<HelloFraandsPage title="Join & earn" summary="Apne fans se private call par kamaayein, apna number private rakhkar.">
<h2>Are you an influencer? Start here.</h2><p>If you create content on YouTube, Instagram, Facebook or another social media platform, {BRAND.name} lets your fans talk to you on a private phone call, and you earn for every minute. Your real phone number stays private. Choose when to go online and which calls to accept. Calls are for conversation, not regulated advice.</p>
<h2>What could you earn?</h2><p>Influencers complete full video KYC and choose a fan price from ₹5 to ₹1,000 per minute; they receive 60% of the connected-call charge minus ₹2.00 per connected minute for the telephone call. Being online does not guarantee calls. Amounts below are before TDS or your own taxes.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Illustrative earnings at a fan price of ₹20 per minute</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Connected talk time</th><th scope="col">Earnings per minute</th><th scope="col">You earn</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 hour</td><td>₹10.00</td><td>₹600</td></tr><tr><td>1,000 minutes</td><td>₹10.00</td><td>₹10,000</td></tr><tr><td>3,000 minutes</td><td>₹10.00</td><td>₹30,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Your earnings and payout status are shown in rupees in your dashboard. See <a href="/hosts/rates">rates, payouts &amp; taxes</a>.</p>
<p>Your privacy is protected. Your phone number stays hidden behind our masked line. Influencers appear only as an AI avatar they chose — never their real photo.</p>
<p>How a call works: when a fan starts a call, we first call you and announce that the fan wants to talk. Press 1 to accept or 2 to decline. If you accept, we then call the fan and merge the two calls. Both calls come from a {BRAND.name} number, so neither real number is shared. The fan is charged per minute at the rate you set.</p>
<h2>Steps to become an influencer</h2><ol><li>Sign up with your own phone number using WhatsApp OTP.</li><li>Verify your Aadhaar with an OTP (or DigiLocker if OTP doesn't work).</li><li>Record a 10-second selfie video.</li><li>Pass a UPI or bank account check.</li><li>Set up your profile: add your languages and topics, and set your rate.</li><li>Go online when you are free to take calls. Payouts go to your own bank account or UPI ID.</li></ol>
<p>Read the <a href="/hosts/requirements">influencer requirements</a>, <a href="/hosts/rules">influencer rules</a> and <a href="/hosts/agreement">influencer agreement</a> before you apply.</p>
<p><a class="hf-button" href="/sign-up">Sign up to become an influencer →</a></p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
